  "title": "Prisoner's Dilemma EEG Dataset",
  "description": "This dataset comprises EEG recordings from a three-person hyperscanning experiment using the prisoner's dilemma game, formatted according to BIDS standards. The dataset includes 11 triads (33 participants total) with simultaneous EEG recordings during decision-making, feedback, and rest periods. EEG data are provided in EEGLAB format (.set files) with behavioral annotations in events.tsv files, enabling investigation of neural correlates of social decision-making and inter-brain synchronization during interactive tasks. This is a BIDS-formatted version of the OpenNeuro dataset (10.18112/openneuro.ds007822.v1.0.0).",
